  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="FR">Morocco&#x2019;s Digital for Sustainable Development Hub (D4SD)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="FR">This project aims to establish the D4SD hub to strengthen digital governance and capabilities, fast track practical AI adoption, and foster and nurture robust regional and international partnerships. In doing so, Morocco will emerge and act as a regional hub and knowledge center helping Arab and African nations harness digital dividends for inclusive growth and sustainable development.</narrative>
  </description>
